  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pypa/virtualenv/zipball/21.15.6",
  "body": "<a name=\"release-21-15-6-fixed\"></a>\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- Clear inherited `PYTHONHOME` during PowerShell, Nushell, and programmatic activation so child interpreters use the environment's standard library. Preserve empty values when Bash and fish deactivate ([#3517](https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3517)) by @gaborbernat.\n- Remove empty `PATH` entries during programmatic activation, including entries in an otherwise nonempty value. On POSIX, an empty entry searches the current directory ([#3513](https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3513)) by @qodelicious and @gaborbernat.\n- Unset `PYTHONHOME` during C shell activation and restore its original value on deactivation. An inherited value could previously prevent the environment's Python interpreter from starting ([#3514](https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3514)) by @abhishekcpp007 and @gaborbernat.\n\n### New Contributors\n\n- @abhishekcpp007 made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3514\n\n[🐍 PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/virtualenv/21.15.6/)\n\n[📜 Full Changelog](https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/compare/21.15.5...21.15.6)\n",
